WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.657 --> 00:00:14.139
right," said Detective Smith.

2
00:00:14.159 --> 00:00:18.402
"The jewel thieves will try to steal the crown jewels next.

3
00:00:19.403 --> 00:00:21.065
We should Rocket Girl?"

4
00:00:23.387 --> 00:00:25.789
A moment later Roxy was in the Metro City Museum.

5
00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:28.752
The whole building was quiet and empty.

6
00:00:33.484 --> 00:00:35.065
The crown jewels were in a large room.

7
00:00:36.045 --> 00:00:39.507
Hundreds of diamonds, emeralds, and rubies sparkled in glass cases.

8
00:00:40.627 --> 00:00:43.648
A large crown sat in a case in the center of the room.

9
00:00:44.909 --> 00:00:46.089
Diamonds covered the crown.

10
00:00:46.109 --> 00:00:49.271
"Hmm," thought Roxy.

11
00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:53.693
"Maybe I was wrong about Suddenly she heard a sound.

12
00:00:54.693 --> 00:00:55.834
Rumble! Rumble!

13
00:01:00.576 --> 00:01:01.236
thought Roxy.

14
00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:03.621
"The jewel thieves are here!"

15
00:01:05.682 --> 00:01:07.423
Roxy hid behind a display case.

16
00:01:08.424 --> 00:01:10.405
A flash of electricity shot through the room.

17
00:01:11.385 --> 00:01:12.146
The lights went out.

18
00:01:12.166 --> 00:01:17.309
"It's a good thing I have my super vision," thought Roxy.

19
00:01:17.329 --> 00:01:19.550
"I can see in the dark."

20
00:01:21.631 --> 00:01:23.792
A group of small figures rushed into the room.

21
00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:26.594
They wore big boots and black vests.

22
00:01:26.614 --> 00:01:29.255
"The Electric Elves!"

23
00:01:29.655 --> 00:01:30.276
Roxy thought.

24
00:01:31.192 --> 00:01:33.833
"They're the worst motorcycle gang in Metro City!"

25
00:01:33.853 --> 00:01:37.975
"Quick!" said the elf leader.

26
00:01:37.995 --> 00:01:40.236
"Put the crown in here!"

27
00:01:41.216 --> 00:01:42.677
He handed a sack to another elf.

28
00:01:44.617 --> 00:01:46.298
Another elf smashed a glass case.

29
00:01:47.619 --> 00:01:48.639
He grabbed some rubies.

30
00:01:48.659 --> 00:01:51.840
"Pretty jewelry!"

31
00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:52.561
he said.

32
00:01:52.581 --> 00:01:54.882
"And it's all ours!"

33
00:01:55.282 --> 00:01:56.062
said another elf.

34
00:01:58.363 --> 00:02:00.684
"No, it's mine," said the leader.

35
00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:04.469
"And if you don't stop talking, I won't share it with you.

36
00:02:05.469 --> 00:02:06.589
Now get to work!"

37
00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:09.650
Roxy stepped out from behind the case.

38
00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:13.391
"Stop right there, you nasty elves!"

39
00:02:13.671 --> 00:02:14.132
she said.

40
00:02:14.152 --> 00:02:17.092
"Rocket Girl!"

41
00:02:17.332 --> 00:02:18.213
cried the elf leader.

42
00:02:18.233 --> 00:02:22.234
"Put back those jewels right now," said Roxy.

43
00:02:22.254 --> 00:02:26.475
"Nobody tells the Electric Elves what to do!"

44
00:02:26.755 --> 00:02:27.375
said the leader.

45
00:02:28.536 --> 00:02:29.556
He raised his hand.

46
00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:31.781
Sparks shot from it.

47
00:02:33.041 --> 00:02:33.881
Roxy smiled.

48
00:02:33.901 --> 00:02:35.882
"You think I'm scared?

49
00:02:36.603 --> 00:02:39.324
I'm Rocket—" Zap!

50
00:02:40.104 --> 00:02:42.405
A bolt of electricity shot from the elf's hand.

51
00:02:43.846 --> 00:02:46.087
"Aah!" Roxy felt a sudden shock.

52
00:02:47.027 --> 00:02:48.488
Electricity buzzed through her.

53
00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:50.549
She fell over.

54
00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:55.511
The elves laughed and grabbed the rest of the jewels.

55
00:02:55.531 --> 00:02:58.696
"Good shot, boss!"

56
00:02:58.716 --> 00:03:00.598
"Rocket Girl won't bother us anymore!"

57
00:03:00.618 --> 00:03:03.380
"Let's go back to our clubhouse!"

58
00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:04.641
said the elf leader.

59
00:03:06.803 --> 00:03:09.145
The elves ran out of the room as Roxy stood up.

60
00:03:09.165 --> 00:03:12.287
"I have to stop those elves!"

61
00:03:12.648 --> 00:03:13.328
thought Roxy.

62
00:03:14.349 --> 00:03:16.551
She leaped into the air but fell back to the floor.

63
00:03:16.571 --> 00:03:19.813
"Ouch!" said Roxy.

64
00:03:20.494 --> 00:03:21.435
She scratched her head.

65
00:03:21.455 --> 00:03:23.596
"Why can't I fly?"

66
00:03:25.738 --> 00:03:27.780
Roxy tried to fire her eye laser beams.

67
00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:30.562
Nothing happened.

68
00:03:32.325 --> 00:03:34.128
Next she tried to use her super breath.

69
00:03:35.451 --> 00:03:36.232
"Oh no!"

70
00:03:36.573 --> 00:03:37.314
Roxy cried.

71
00:03:37.334 --> 00:03:39.679
"I lost my super powers!"
